# qforge extra-firmware pin — VENDOR blobs that are neither in linux-firmware nor in the
# Nova-Deck/qcom-firmwares repo, republished by ROCKNIX in ROCKNIX/extra-firmware (one
# directory per SoC, pulled from each device's Android image). Pinned by commit + per-file sha256,
# fetched by firmware/fetch-extra-fw.sh into firmware/extra-fw/ (git-ignored) — the same row
# format and the same fetch logic as LINUX_FW.pin, against a raw.githubusercontent base.
#
# Columns:  <src-path-in-extra-firmware>  <install-path-under-/lib/firmware>  <sha256>
#
# Why a third source rather than rows in QCOM_FW.pin: fetch-qcom-fw.sh takes the whole
# qcom-firmwares repo at a commit and trusts its sha256sums.txt; extra-firmware has no sidecar
# and we want a handful of its files, not the tree. Per-file rows with their own sha are the honest
# shape for that, and they are what LINUX_FW.pin already does.
#
# Added 2026-10-09 for SM6115 (MANGMI Air X / Air Y). The commit is the one ROCKNIX's `next`
# pins (projects/ROCKNIX/packages/linux-firmware/extra-firmware/package.mk, after their
# "sm6115: remove firmware from main repo" move); every sha was taken from the file downloaded at
# that commit.
commit: 925dfb5efbe5d6c3ca654f81e3e1f367f8492777
base:   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ROCKNIX/extra-firmware
# --- SM6115 MANGMI Air X / Air Y -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Qualcomm-side blobs signed for the MANGMI boards. ROCKNIX moved from the QRB4210 dev-board set in
# linux-firmware to these on 2026-10-05 (their Air X base DTS names qcom/sm6115/mangmi/ for the GPU
# zap shader, the cDSP and the modem; only the aDSP stays the open qrb4210 one, LINUX_FW.pin). The
# modem is what carries Wi-Fi: wlanmdsp.mbn is the WLAN firmware the modem fetches over QRTR TFTP
# (tqftpserv resolves it from the modem's firmware-name directory, this one).
SM6115/qcom/sm6115/mangmi/a610_zap.mbn   qcom/sm6115/mangmi/a610_zap.mbn   dcb29e62a04a09513a8610a8632e0b79fffb75056487c00b4b8377f2ea69aa4a
SM6115/qcom/sm6115/mangmi/cdsp.mbn       qcom/sm6115/mangmi/cdsp.mbn       2148fb252e9cf5f68b1618e74e8b5a1d2400a32c50e51bcdc9386c6642138511
SM6115/qcom/sm6115/mangmi/modem.mbn      qcom/sm6115/mangmi/modem.mbn      d2344167f7537e1314d8ded88bb53ba506354587a57780fa57b1f11fc26b5b9c
SM6115/qcom/sm6115/mangmi/wlanmdsp.mbn   qcom/sm6115/mangmi/wlanmdsp.mbn   dcbd7cfaeaac81dbb49dffc0df13e6f6dd4e0623d344732b74bcf3f7bb5d61b3
